 "notes": "After the Casio CZ-1 manual: two lines per voice, each phase distortion (saw, square) or resonance (ramp or triangle window), with its own DCW and DCA envelopes; a pitch envelope, line 2 detune, ring and noise modulation, vibrato with delay, key follow on DCW and DCA, velocity. Eight voices. The CZ's envelopes have eight steps, these three and a release."
